Ya Ali mushkil kusha apse fariyad hai,<br>
Aaiye behre Khuda apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Der na ab kijiye jald khabar lijiye,<br>
Behre Rasule Khuda apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Dil hai hamara malool behre janabe Batool,<br>
Behre Hassan Mujtaba apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Deti hu mai wasta hazrate Shabbir ka,<br>
Behre aseer e bala apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Baqar o Jaffer ki hai apko Moula qasam,<br>
Az paye Kazim Raza apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Behre Taqi o Naqi behre Hassan Askari,<br>
Jald ho sehat ata apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Az paye Mehdi e dee'n jitne hai sab mominee'n,<br>
Ghum na ho unko zara apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Akbaro Abbas ka wasta Shabbir ka,<br>
Ap hai Shere Khuda apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Zainab o Kulsoom ka Asghar e masoom ka,<br>
Deti hu mai wasta apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Auno Mohammed ka aur Qasime nashaad ka,<br>
Kijiye sadqa ata apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
De rahi hu wasta Bali Sakina ka mai,<br>
Aye Shahe uqdakusha apse fariyad hai.<br>
<br>
Apke dar se Shaha koi na sahil phira,<br>
Mujhko bhi ho kuch ata apse fariyad hai...